OL,3,GNEWSAPresenter may have set
OL,4,Ahalf-marathon world record
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new Guinness World Record may have
OL,7,Fbeen set at Worcester City Half
OL,8,FMarathon, by BBC Hereford and
OL,9,FWorcester.
OL,11,FSteve Cram, a silver medallist in the
OL,12,F1,500m at the 1984 games, set the local
OL,13,Fradio station the challenge of running
OL,14,Fthe fastest half marathon while
OL,15,Fpresenting a live radio show.
OL,17,FThat challenge was taken up by
OL,18,Fexecutive producer Tim Boswell who
OL,19,Fcompleted the race in a little over two
OL,20,Fhours and twenty minutes.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
