OL,3,GNEWSAPresenter may have set
OL,4,Ahalf-marathon world record
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said support from the crowds had
OL,7,Fbeen "amazing", adding "I think events
OL,8,Flike this show off the best of
OL,9,Feverybody... it was absolutely
OL,10,Ffantastic".
